@startuml
node "Máy chạy demo / server" {
component "iot_producer.py" as Producer
database "SQLite event feed (volume)" as Feed
component "Streamlit app.py (fragment 2 giây)" as App
component "core.telemetry / scheduler" as Core
Producer --> Feed
Feed --> Core : polling theo cursor
App --> Core
}
node "Trình duyệt A" as A
node "Trình duyệt B" as B
A --> App : HTTP / Streamlit session
B --> App : HTTP / Streamlit session
note bottom of App
Mỗi phiên có state nghiệp vụ riêng.
Cùng nhận feed cảm biến đã lưu.
end note
@enduml
